1
00:00:00,254 --> 00:00:02,044
(Penny:)No. You're wrong.

2
00:00:03,716 --> 00:00:05,426
SHELDON:
This is great.

3
00:00:05,592 --> 00:00:08,472
(Sheldon(now in a sparkly green suit with rhinestones):)I had a suit like this when I was six.

4
00:00:12,975 --> 00:00:15,765
SHELDON:
Okay, I think we have a winner.

5
00:00:17,479 --> 00:00:21,569
-Where the hell did you find that?
-In the prom department.

6
00:00:21,734 --> 00:00:22,984
(Penny:)It's ridiculous.

7
00:00:23,652 --> 00:00:26,742
(Sheldon:)Says the former member
of the corn queen's court.

8
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:31,410
-Please just try this one on?
-Okay.

9
00:00:31,577 --> 00:00:35,117
(Sheldon:)But anything I put on now
is only gonna suffer in comparison.

10
00:00:42,296 --> 00:00:44,466
(Sheldon:)This is absurd. I look like a clown.

11
00:00:49,178 --> 00:00:51,098
(Leonard:)So, Sheldon...

12
00:00:53,182 --> 00:00:54,972
(Leonard:)...how you doing?

13
00:00:56,435 --> 00:00:58,605
(Sheldon:)That's how you start
a psychotherapy session?

14
00:00:58,771 --> 00:01:00,651
(Sheldon:)How am I doing?

